			<<ind>><<link [[수영장 가장자리에 식용유를 뿌린다 (0:01)|Mansion Chase Pool Trap]]>><<pass 1>><<avery_mansion_chase_location>><<avery_mansion_chase_trap "pool">><<set $avery_mansion.chase.gear.delete("oil")>><</link>>
