:: Mansion Chase Hallway 2 Marbles
<<effects>>

당신은 계단 꼭대기 근처 바닥에 구슬 주머니를 쏟아붓는다. 보지 않고 밟는 사람은 심하게 넘어질 위험이 있다.
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Mansion Chase Hallway 2]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Mansion Chase Hallway 2 W
<<set $outside to 0>><<effects>>

<<set $avery_mansion.chase.bus to "hallway_2_w">>
당신은 에이버리 저택 2층 서쪽 복도에 있다.

<<avery_mansion_chase_state>>
<<switch $avery_mansion.chase.state>>
	<<case "victory">>
		<<avery_mansion_trap_victory>>
	<<case "caught">>
		<<avery_mansion_chase_caught>>
	<<default>>
		<<avery_mansion_chase>>

		<<icon "avery-bedroom.png">><<link [[침실 (0:01)|Mansion Chase Bedroom]]>><<pass 1>><<avery_mansion_chase_location>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<icon "avery-hallway.png">><<link [[계단참 (0:01)|Mansion Chase Hallway 2]]>><<pass 1>><<avery_mansion_chase_location>><</link>>
		<br>
<</switch>>

:: Mansion Chase Hallway 2 E
<<set $outside to 0>><<effects>>

<<set $avery_mansion.chase.bus to "hallway_2_e">>
