<</switch>>

:: Mansion Chase Hallway 3
<<set $outside to 0>><<effects>>

<<if $phase is 1>>
	계단을 오르자 삐걱거리는 소리가 난다. <span class="red">에이버리가 들었을 것이다.</span>
	<br><br>
<</if>>

<<set $avery_mansion.chase.bus to "hallway_3">>
당신은 에이버리 저택 3층, <<his>> 서재로 이어지는 긴 복도에 있다.

<<avery_mansion_chase_state>>
<<switch $avery_mansion.chase.state>>
	<<case "victory">>
		<<avery_mansion_trap_victory>>
	<<case "caught">>
		<<avery_mansion_chase_caught>>
	<<default>>
		<<avery_mansion_chase>>

		<<if $phase is 1>>
			<<icon "avery-hallway.png">><<link [[아래층 (0:01)|Mansion Chase Hallway 2 E]]>><<pass 1>><<avery_mansion_chase_location "sound_stairs_2">><</link>>
			<br>
			<<icon "avery-study.png">><<link [[서재 (0:01)|Mansion Chase Study]]>><<pass 1>><<avery_mansion_chase_location "sound_stairs_2">><</link>>
			<br>
		<<else>>
			<<icon "avery-hallway.png">><<link [[아래층 (0:01)|Mansion Chase Hallway 2 E]]>><<pass 1>><<avery_mansion_chase_location>><</link>>
			<br>
			<<icon "avery-study.png">><<link [[서재 (0:01)|Mansion Chase Study]]>><<pass 1>><<avery_mansion_chase_location>><</link>>
			<br>
		<</if>>
<</switch>>

<<set $phase to 0>>
